#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.floordiv:1 of
msgid "Element-wise floor division (``lf // other``)."
msgstr "元素级地板除法（``lf // other``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.floordiv:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``//`` operator (``__floordiv__``), so ``lf // other`` is "
"equivalent to ``lf.floordiv(other)``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``//`` 运算符（``__floordiv__``），所以 ``lf // other`` 等价于 ``"
"lf.floordiv(other)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.floordiv of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.floordiv:6 of
msgid "Value to floor-divide each element of ``lf`` by."
msgstr "用于对 ``lf`` 的每个元素进行地板除的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.floordiv of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.floordiv:9 of
msgid "Lazy frame with element-wise floored quotient of ``lf`` and ``other``."
msgstr "包含 ``lf`` 和 ``other`` 元素级地板商的惰性框架。"

